  "Tutorial Start",
  "Just now, as the turn began, did",
  "the message 'Materiel +120'",
  "catch your eye? It's one",
  "you haven't seen before.",
  "Here,",
  "let's go over",
  "the [Supply Rules].",
  "In all stages from here on,",
  "with a few exceptions,",
  "these [Supply Rules]",
  "will always apply.",
  "Please take this chance",
  "to learn the basics",
  "thoroughly.",
  "The [Supply Rules]",
  "are made up of",
  "two elements:",
  "'Supply' and 'Cost'.",
  "Now let's explain",
  "those two elements",
  "one at a time.",
  "First, 'Supply'.",
  "When you select a team,",
  "on the top screen,",
  "please look at this part",
  "of the team info.",
  "The 'Supply' figure",
  "shown here",
  "is the team's",
  "'Supply value', and",
  "the 'Supply' of all teams",
  "on the stage at that time",
  "is then totaled.",
  "At the start of every turn,",
  "that total is added",
  "to your 'Materiel'.",
  "When the turn began,",
  "you likely saw",
  "--that was the 'Supply' notice.",
  "the amount supplied",
  "builds up here",
  "on the top screen",
  "as 'Materiel'.",
  "Note: the upper row shows",
  "your 'Materiel', the lower row",
  "the enemy's.",
  "Now, this Team A,",
  "as the top screen shows,",
  "has a 'Supply' of 0,",
  "so it cannot supply.",
  "As a rule, the units",
  "with a 'Supply' value",
  "are ship-type units;",
  "in this stage,",
  "White Base",
  "is the one.",
  "As shown here",
  "on the top screen,",
  "it has a 'Supply'",
  "value of 120.",
  "Next, 'Cost'.",
  "On the top screen now,",
  "This 'Cost' figure",
  "is the base value used when",
  "the team moves, fights or",
  "takes other actions.",
  "When moving,",
  "'Cost' x 'Distance'",
  "is the amount of",
  "the 'Materiel' shown here",
  "on the top screen",
  "that will be spent.",
  "Also, when fighting,",
  "'Cost' x 3",
  "is likewise the amount",
  "Now, for real,",
  "take this Team C,",
  "and let's try moving it.",
  "Now, look at this frame",
  "next to the arrow",
  "showing the destination.",
  "From the top, it shows",
  "'Your current Materiel',",
  "'Materiel used to move',",
  "'Materiel left after acting',",
  "each with",
  "its value.",
  "Now, this time, pick",
  "an area where combat occurs,",
  "In a frame like the one before,",
  "an item called \"BATTLE\"",
  "has been newly added,",
  "as you can see.",
  "This is the 'Cost'",
  "of fighting, and",
  "in the bottom row,",
  "'Materiel left after acting',",
  "it is subtracted",
  "as well.",
  "That's all for now",
  "about 'Cost'",
  "when moving,",
  "so let's go back.",
  "Since each unit",
  "has its own 'Cost' value,",
  "teams with many units",
  "naturally have higher values.",
  "Team C, which has only",
  "White Base,",
  "as the top screen shows,",
  "has a 'Cost' of 6, but",
  "Team A, with no fewer",
  "than ten Saberfish,",
  "has a 'Cost' of 60,",
  "quite a large figure.",
  "The bigger the outfit,",
  "the more energy it uses.",
  "People and machines",
  "are alike in that.",
  "Of course, if you lack",
  "enough 'Materiel',",
  "you cannot",
  "move, but",
  "battle alone",
  "is still possible",
  "even without enough 'Materiel'.",
  "However, the price is that",
  "your strength drops",
  "to half its actual value.",
  "In other words,",
  "you'll be at a severe",
  "disadvantage.",
  "When moving to fight,",
  "plan your 'Materiel' to cover",
  "both the move and",
  "the battle that follows.",
  "Note that",
  "if every team",
  "with 'Supply'",
  "is destroyed,",
  "then naturally, from then on,",
  "there will be no 'Supply'",
  "at all each turn,",
  "and 'Materiel' will not grow.",
  "When that happens,",
  "if 'Materiel' remains,",
  "you can still act",
  "as far as it lasts,",
  "but if your remaining 'Materiel'",
  "runs low",
  "or runs out entirely,",
  "you can do nothing.",
  "If that happens,",
  "open the System Menu",
  "and select",
  "[Give Up]",
  "to restart the stage",
  "from the beginning.",
  "But this is strictly",
  "a last resort.",
  "We recommend that you fight",
  "taking every care to keep",
  "your teams with 'Supply'",
  "from being destroyed.",
  "This concludes",
  "the explanation of",
